# Device-class profile: 1st-gen Jetson Nano (JetPack 4, L4T R32) — weak CPU,
# no usable GPU inference path. Sourced by deploy/run-node.sh (see orin.env
# for how profiles work).
#
# stride 2: the Nano is CPU-bound on RVL+color, and full resolution drops it
# well below the sensor's 30 fps; measured 27.5 fps at stride 2. No pose —
# the skeleton model needs the Orin-class GPU (central-side inference is the
# documented fallback for this class).
PROFILE_EXTRA_ARGS='--preview-stride 2'
